      {
        "name": "places/ChIJLeXKBt4FBDQREZX6avwN04g/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxaldUQk9aM0ZVVjJNelZUVnhSbUZIWnpBeE9YYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "We came in a group of 6 as tourist after receiving special discount coupons after spending in a small shop in Sai Kung. The service experience in this outlet was horrible. Every question was either answer with a cold attitude or not answer by the cashier lady.\nWhen we ask the lady if the cold brew was black or white , the answer is “we only have black” with unfriendly tone.\nWhen we presented 1 coupon, we were asked on how many coupons we have. We asked in return if the offer of 10% is only valid per cup of coffee instead of all coffees within the bill since the voucher did not state clearly. No answer was given by the lady. We handed all 3 coupons we had in the end.\nOnce we settled the bill, and asked for the receipts , the answers given was “no receipt” with unfriendly tone and straight face.\nThere is no transparency on what is the terms and conditions of this offer at all.\n\nWith the price paid, definitely there are better options.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "We came in a group of 6 as tourist after receiving special discount coupons after spending in a small shop in Sai Kung. The service experience in this outlet was horrible. Every question was either answer with a cold attitude or not answer by the cashier lady.\nWhen we ask the lady if the cold brew was black or white , the answer is “we only have black” with unfriendly tone.\nWhen we presented 1 coupon, we were asked on how many coupons we have. We asked in return if the offer of 10% is only valid per cup of coffee instead of all coffees within the bill since the voucher did not state clearly. No answer was given by the lady. We handed all 3 coupons we had in the end.\nOnce we settled the bill, and asked for the receipts , the answers given was “no receipt” with unfriendly tone and straight face.\nThere is no transparency on what is the terms and conditions of this offer at all.\n\nWith the price paid, definitely there are better options.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
