        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxaldUQk9aM0ZVVjJNelZUVnhSbUZIWnpBeE9YYxAB!2m1!1s0x340405de06cae52d:0x88d30dfc6afa9511"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJLeXKBt4FBDQREZX6avwN04g/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsamNVdEdaaTFMT1RsVlh5MWtNRk5QYVRkQkxVRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這是我第一次去西貢的Winston Coffee，體驗非常棒。咖啡館環境優美，是理想的咖啡休憩之所，尤其方便的是還有戶外停車位。店內氛圍輕鬆舒適，讓人放鬆身心，享受片刻寧靜。飲品更是美味至極——你能真切地感受到製作者的用心和對品質的把控。特別感謝Anthony，他非常熱情友善，讓我的體驗更加完美。我一定會再來的！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "It was my first time visiting Winston Coffee in Sai Kung and I had such a great experience. The location is beautiful and makes for a perfect coffee stop, especially with the convenience of outdoor parking. The atmosphere was relaxed and welcoming, making it easy to sit back and enjoy the moment. The drinks were absolutely amazing — you can really taste the quality and care that goes into them. A special thank you to Anthony, who was incredibly friendly and made the experience even better. I’ll definitely be coming back!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
